    <bpmn:process id="W_W4377" name="W4377. Store/Unit Service-Findings Feedback &amp; Corrective Action" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Triage finding (W4376)
Frequency: Per finding + batch feedback
Volume: All service findings routed to units
Owner: Service Quality / Store Ops (VS-07) / CX (VS-13)
Participants: Service Quality, Store/Unit Leadership, CX (VS-13), HR (VS-103), Sales Enablement (VS-124)
Source: workflow W4377 — Store/Unit Service-Findings Feedback &amp; Corrective Action</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4377_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4377_Lane1" name="Service Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4377_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4377_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4377_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4377_Lane2" name="Unit Leadership">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4377_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4377_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4377_Start4" name="Triage finding (W4376)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4377_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4377_Task5" name="Service Quality route findings to the responsible unit/store with evidence &amp;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Service Quality route findings to the responsible unit/store with evidence &amp; score, within a feedback SLA (days)
Responsible (R): Service Quality
Accountable (A): Service Quality Lead
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4377_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4377_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4377_Task6" name="Unit leadership acknowledge, plan corrective action (coaching, retraining…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Unit leadership acknowledge, plan corrective action (coaching, retraining, process fix), and execute within an agreed timeframe
Responsible (R): Unit Leadership / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Store Mgr / Unit Lead
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4377_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4377_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4377_Task7" name="Service Quality/HR verify corrective-action completion, confirm behavior change…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Service Quality/HR verify corrective-action completion, confirm behavior change in subsequent shops, and close the finding
Responsible (R): Service Quality / HR
Accountable (A): Service Quality Lead
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4377_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4377_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4377_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4377_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4377_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-670 (ensure controlled execution — Findings Remediation, Recognition &amp; Service-Quality Analytics (PA-146.3).) | - CTL-670: findings routed within SLA; corrective action verified &amp; closed; behavior change confirmed
Owner: Service Quality / Store Ops (VS-07) / CX (VS-13)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4377_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4377_Annotation9" targetRef="W4377_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4377_Flow11" sourceRef="W4377_Start4" targetRef="W4377_Task5" />
