    <bpmn:process id="W_W4379" name="W4379. Service Recognition, Incentive &amp; Performance Linkage" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Performance cycle; KPI review (W4364)
Frequency: Periodic (monthly/quarterly)
Volume: Service-performance recognition across stores/associates
Owner: HR (VS-102/VS-103) / Service Quality / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: HR (VS-102/VS-103), Service Quality, Store Ops (VS-07), Finance (VS-17.4), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4379 — Service Recognition, Incentive &amp; Performance Linkage</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4379_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4379_Lane1" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4379_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4379_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4379_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4379_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4379_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4379_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4379_Start4" name="Performance cycle; KPI review (W4364)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4379_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4379_Task5" name="HR/Service Quality link service-quality KPI (W4364) to recognition/incentive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR/Service Quality link service-quality KPI (W4364) to recognition/incentive (service-excellence awards, variable-pay component VS-102.3) within fairness/ethics (W4365)
Responsible (R): HR / Service Quality
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4379_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4379_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4379_Task6" name="HR/Store Ops administer recognition &amp; incentive payouts based on validated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Store Ops administer recognition &amp; incentive payouts based on validated scores (W4375), with the dispute path (W4380) available
Responsible (R): HR / Store Ops
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4379_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4379_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4379_Task7" name="Finance/HR track incentive cost vs service/CX outcome (ROI), and tune the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/HR track incentive cost vs service/CX outcome (ROI), and tune the incentive design
Responsible (R): Finance / HR
Accountable (A): CFO / CHRO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4379_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4379_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4379_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4379_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4379_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-670 (ensure controlled execution — Findings Remediation, Recognition &amp; Service-Quality Analytics (PA-146.3).) | - CTL-670: incentive linked to validated KPI (W4364/W4375); integrity-controlled (W4381); balanced recognition; dispute path (W4380)
Owner: HR (VS-102/VS-103) / Service Quality / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
