    <bpmn:process id="W_W4380" name="W4380. Service-Finding Dispute, Validation &amp; Appeal" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Associate/unit disputes a finding
Frequency: Per dispute
Volume: Service-finding disputes (proportional to findings)
Owner: Service Quality / HR (VS-84) / Labor Relations (VS-84)
Participants: Service Quality, HR (VS-103), Labor Relations (VS-84), Store Ops (VS-07), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4380 — Service-Finding Dispute, Validation &amp; Appeal</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4380_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4380_Lane1" name="Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4380_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4380_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4380_Lane2" name="Service Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4380_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4380_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4380_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4380_Start4" name="Associate/unit disputes a finding">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4380_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4380_Task5" name="Associate/unit raise a dispute on a finding (factual error, context, fairness)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Associate/unit raise a dispute on a finding (factual error, context, fairness) via a defined channel within a window
Responsible (R): Associate / Unit
Accountable (A): Service Quality Lead / HR
Duration: Per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4380_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4380_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4380_Task6" name="Service Quality/HR re-validate the evidence (W4375), investigate context, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Service Quality/HR re-validate the evidence (W4375), investigate context, and determine uphold/correct/withdraw with due process (W4365)
Responsible (R): Service Quality / HR
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality / CHRO
Duration: Per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4380_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4380_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4380_Task7" name="Service Quality/HR communicate outcome, adjust records/scores if corrected, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Service Quality/HR communicate outcome, adjust records/scores if corrected, and ensure no retaliation for disputing
Responsible (R): Service Quality / HR
Accountable (A): Head of Service Quality / CHRO
