    <bpmn:process id="W_W4384" name="W4384. Service-Quality Program Maturity, ROI &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; program maturity assessment
Frequency: Annual + ongoing
Volume: Program maturity/ROI/improvement
Owner: Service Quality / Strategy (VS-33) / OpEx (VS-133) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Service Quality, Strategy (VS-33), OpEx (VS-133), Finance (VS-17.4), CX (VS-13), HR (VS-103)
Source: workflow W4384 — Service-Quality Program Maturity, ROI &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4384_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4384_Lane1" name="Service Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4384_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4384_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4384_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4384_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4384_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4384_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4384_Start4" name="Annual review; program maturity assessment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4384_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4384_Task5" name="Service Quality/Strategy assess program maturity (coverage, methodology…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Service Quality/Strategy assess program maturity (coverage, methodology, integrity, action-effectiveness, analytics) vs a maturity model, and identify gaps
Responsible (R): Service Quality / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO / Head of Service Quality
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4384_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4384_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4384_Task6" name="Finance/Service Quality quantify program ROI (service/CX improvement →…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/Service Quality quantify program ROI (service/CX improvement → conversion/repeat/retention value vs program cost incl agency)
Responsible (R): Finance / Service Quality / CX
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4384_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4384_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4384_Task7" name="Service Quality/OpEx drive continuous improvement (methodology, coverage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Service Quality/OpEx drive continuous improvement (methodology, coverage, integrity, analytics, action-effectiveness), and prioritize investment
Responsible (R): Service Quality / OpEx / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4384_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4384_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4384_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4384_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4384_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-670 (ensure controlled execution — Findings Remediation, Recognition &amp; Service-Quality Analytics (PA-146.3).) | - CTL-670: program maturity assessed; ROI quantified; continuous improvement driven; investment prioritized
Owner: Service Quality / Strategy (VS-33) / OpEx (VS-133) / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
